r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, April to May came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 that same middle ran 29% of normal in January to February and 265% of normal in March to April. Grid 16025 had its driest year in 1952, at 50% of normal.</p>"}
